      {
        "id": "f901f8ddd77f4b16937c93112139c51c",
        "title": "从素材到故事",
        "description": "【画幅与基调】16:9 纯白底，主色为深蓝（约 #1B4DFF）与浅蓝线框，中文字体为无衬线黑体（如思源黑体）。全程无旁白、无配乐。\n\n【0.0–1.5s】画面左侧集中出现 6 个蓝色空心小方块（素材缩略图占位，内部无真实图片），以 2×3 的松散阵列轻轻浮现；中央偏右出现三行中文标签：「选取」「编排」「成片」。\n\n【1.5–4.0s】6 个方块依次向右移动并分成三条细流：上支 2 个方块、中支 2 个、下支 2 个，沿三条浅蓝曲线滑向右上、右中、右下三个分支节点。分支节点为小圆点，每个节点旁出现更小的中文提示：「镜头顺序」「画面组合」「节奏点」。\n\n【4.0–7.0s】三条分支线条向画面中右方的矩形框汇合；矩形框以蓝色描边逐步画出，作为「预览画面」容器。分支线条淡出，矩形框内出现居中中文「故事预览」，其下方简短出现「素材 → 镜头 → 成片」一行小字。\n\n【7.0–10.0s】预览框保持稳定，左侧缩略方块阵收缩为一条细蓝色进度线；右侧预览框四角出现取景角标，画面整体停留 1.5 秒供阅读，最后元素轻微淡出，结束本段。\n\n【实际画面文字与出现时间】「选取」「编排」「成片」三词 0.0s 出现、4.0s 淡出；「镜头顺序」「画面组合」「节奏点」1.5s 随分支出现、4.0s 淡出；「故事预览」4.0s 出现并保持到 10.0s；「素材 → 镜头 → 成片」4.8s 出现、8.5s 淡出。",
        "duration": 10.0,
        "source_revision_id": "8bdc70997a1e405bb7fc0e99c81210e9",
        "source_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>从素材到故事</title>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#ffffff;}\n  #stage{position:relative;width:1280px;height:720px;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;\n    font-family:'PingFang SC','Arial',sans-serif;}\n  .abs{position:absolute;}\n  .label{font-size:30px;color:#1B4DFF;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:500;}\n  .hint{font-size:22px;color:#7C97FF;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .prevTitle{font-size:40px;color:#1B4DFF;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:600;}\n  .sub{font-size:22px;color:#5B78E6;letter-spacing:2px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"stage\">\n  <div id=\"labelsWrap\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"hintsWrap\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"squaresWrap\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <svg id=\"lines\" class=\"abs\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" style=\"left:0;top:0;\"></svg>\n  <div id=\"previewBox\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"prevText\" class=\"abs prevTitle\" style=\"opacity:0;\">故事预览</div>\n  <div id=\"prevSub\" class=\"abs sub\" style=\"opacity:0;\">素材 → 镜头 → 成片</div>\n  <div id=\"progressLine\" class=\"abs\" style=\"opacity:0;height:3px;background:#1B4DFF;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\n  <svg id=\"corners\" class=\"abs\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" style=\"left:0;top:0;pointer-events:none;\"></svg>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n\n  // ---------- 静态布局参数 ----------\n  // 左侧素材方块 2列x3行 阵列\n  var sqSize = 56;\n  var sqGapX = 26, sqGapY = 26;\n  var baseX = 150, baseY = 250;\n  var squarePositions = [];\n  for(var r=0;r<3;r++){\n    for(var c=0;c<2;c++){\n      squarePositions.push({\n        x: baseX + c*(sqSize+sqGapX),\n        y: baseY + r*(sqSize+sqGapY)\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  // 三条分支终点\n  var branchNode = [\n    {x: 780, y: 200},\n    {x: 800, y: 360},\n    {x: 780, y: 520}\n  ];\n\n  // 分支节点旁的提示文字\n  var hintTexts = [\n    {t:'镜头顺序', x: branchNode[0].x+34, y: branchNode[0].y-2},\n    {t:'画面组合', x: branchNode[1].x+34, y: branchNode[1].y-2},\n    {t:'节奏点',   x: branchNode[2].x+34, y: branchNode[2].y-2}\n  ];\n\n  // 预览框\n  var box = {x: 860, y: 240, w: 320, h: 240};\n\n  // 三行标签位置\n  var labelPos = [\n    {t:'选取', x: 400, y: 300},\n    {t:'编排', x: 400, y: 356},\n    {t:'成片', x: 400, y: 412}\n  ];\n\n  // ---------- 构建 DOM ----------\n  var labelsWrap = document.getElementById('labelsWrap');\n  var hintsWrap = document.getElementById('hintsWrap');\n  var squaresWrap = document.getElementById('squaresWrap');\n\n  var labelEls = [];\n  labelPos.forEach(function(p){\n    var d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'abs label';\n    d.textContent = p.t;\n    d.style.left = p.x+'px';\n    d.style.top = p.y+'px';\n    d.style.opacity = '0';\n    labelsWrap.appendChild(d);\n    labelEls.push(d);\n  });\n\n  var hintEls = [];\n  hintTexts.forEach(function(p){\n    var d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'abs hint';\n    d.textContent = p.t;\n    d.style.left = p.x+'px';\n    d.style.top = p.y+'px';\n    d.style.opacity = '0';\n    hintsWrap.appendChild(d);\n    hintEls.push(d);\n  });\n\n  var squareEls = [];\n  squarePositions.forEach(function(p){\n    var d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'abs';\n    d.style.width = sqSize+'px';\n    d.style.height = sqSize+'px';\n    d.style.boxSizing = 'border-box';\n    d.style.border = '2.5px solid #1B4DFF';\n    d.style.borderRadius = '4px';\n    d.style.opacity = '0';\n    d.style.left = '0px';\n    d.style.top = '0px';\n    squaresWrap.appendChild(d);\n    squareEls.push(d);\n  });\n\n  var svg = document.getElementById('lines');\n  var NS = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n\n  // 分支曲线（从方块区域右缘到节点）\n  function makeCurve(node){\n    var path = document.createElementNS(NS,'path');\n    path.setAttribute('fill','none');\n    path.setAttribute('stroke','#9FB6FF');\n    path.setAttribute('stroke-width','2');\n    path.setAttribute('stroke-linecap','round');\n    svg.appendChild(path);\n    return path;\n  }\n  var branchPaths = branchNode.map(makeCurve);\n\n  // 节点圆点\n  var nodeCircles = branchNode.map(function(n){\n    var c = document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    c.setAttribute('cx', n.x);\n    c.setAttribute('cy', n.y);\n    c.setAttribute('r', 6);\n    c.setAttribute('fill','#1B4DFF');\n    c.setAttribute('opacity','0');\n    svg.appendChild(c);\n    return c;\n  });\n\n  // 汇合曲线（节点到预览框左缘），三条\n  var mergePaths = branchNode.map(function(n){\n    var p = document.createElementNS(NS,'path');\n    p.setAttribute('fill','none');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke','#C7D5FF');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke-width','2');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke-linecap','round');\n    svg.appendChild(p);\n    return p;\n  });\n\n  // ---------- 预览框（四条边逐步描边）----------\n  var previewBox = document.getElementById('previewBox');\n  previewBox.style.left = box.x+'px';\n  previewBox.style.top = box.y+'px';\n  previewBox.style.width = box.w+'px';\n  previewBox.style.height = box.h+'px';\n  previewBox.style.boxSizing = 'border-box';\n  previewBox.style.borderRadius = '6px';\n  previewBox.style.background = '#F7F9FF';\n\n  var edgeDefs = [\n    // top: left->right\n    {x1:0, y1:0, x2:box.w, y2:0, delay:4.0},\n    // right: top->bottom\n    {x1:box.w, y1:0, x2:box.w, y2:box.h, delay:4.25},\n    // bottom: right->left\n    {x1:box.w, y1:box.h, x2:0, y2:box.h, delay:4.5},\n    // left: bottom->top\n    {x1:0, y1:box.h, x2:0, y2:0, delay:4.75}\n  ];\n  var edgeEls = edgeDefs.map(function(e){\n    var d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'abs';\n    d.style.background = '#1B4DFF';\n    d.style.borderRadius = '1px';\n    d.style.opacity = '0';\n    previewBox.appendChild(d);\n    return d;\n  });\n\n  var prevText = document.getElementById('prevText');\n  var prevSub = document.getElementById('prevSub');\n  var progressLine = document.getElementById('progressLine');\n\n  var cornersSvg = document.getElementById('corners');\n  var cornerEls = [];\n  // 四个取景角标（L 形）\n  var cornerGeo = [\n    // 左上\n    {x:box.x-6, y:box.y-6, hx:1, hy:1},\n    // 右上\n    {x:box.x+box.w+6, y:box.y-6, hx:-1, hy:1},\n    // 左下\n    {x:box.x-6, y:box.y+box.h+6, hx:1, hy:-1},\n    // 右下\n    {x:box.x+box.w+6, y:box.y+box.h+6, hx:-1, hy:-1}\n  ];\n  cornerGeo.forEach(function(g){\n    var p = document.createElementNS(NS,'path');\n    var len = 22;\n    var d = 'M '+(g.x+g.hx*len)+' '+g.y+' L '+g.x+' '+g.y+' L '+g.x+' '+(g.y+g.hy*len);\n    p.setAttribute('d', d);\n    p.setAttribute('fill','none');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke','#1B4DFF');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke-width','3');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke-linecap','round');\n    p.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin','round');\n    p.setAttribute('opacity','0');\n    cornersSvg.appendChild(p);\n    cornerEls.push(p);\n  });\n\n  // ---------- 工具函数 ----------\n  function clamp(v,a,b){ return v<a?a:(v>b?b:v); }\n  function easeOut(t){ t=clamp(t,0,1); return 1-Math.pow(1-t,3); }\n  function easeInOut(t){ t=clamp(t,0,1); return t<0.5? 2*t*t : 1-Math.pow(-2*t+2,2)/2; }\n  function seg(t, a, b){ return clamp((t-a)/(b-a), 0, 1); }\n\n  // 计算方块的路径位置（用于 1.5–4.0 的移动）\n  // 分三支：索引 0,1 -> 上; 2,3 -> 中; 4,5 -> 下\n  function squareTarget(i){\n    var branch = Math.floor(i/2);\n    var n = branchNode[branch];\n    var offsetIndex = i%2;\n    return {\n      x: n.x - sqSize/2 + (offsetIndex===0? -18: 18),\n      y: n.y - sqSize/2\n    };\n  }\n\n  // ---------- 主渲染 ----------\n  window.renderAt = function(t){\n    t = Math.max(0, Math.min(10, t));\n\n    // 三行文字 0.0–4.0\n    var labelAlpha = 1;\n    if(t < 0.35){ labelAlpha = easeOut(seg(t,0,0.35)); }\n    if(t > 3.7){ labelAlpha = 1 - easeOut(seg(t,3.7,4.0)); }\n    labelEls.forEach(function(el,i){\n      var appear = easeOut(seg(t, 0.15 + i*0.12, 0.55 + i*0.12));\n      var a = labelAlpha * appear;\n      el.style.opacity = a.toFixed(3);\n      el.style.transform = 'translateX(' + ((1-appear)*(-16)) + 'px)';\n    });\n\n    // 方块出现 0.0–1.5 松散浮现\n    squareEls.forEach(function(el,i){\n      var ap = easeOut(seg(t, 0.05 + i*0.08, 0.5 + i*0.08));\n      var startP = squarePositions[i];\n\n      // 阶段：1.5–4.0 向右移动并分三支\n      var mv = seg(t, 1.5 + (i%2)*0.12 + Math.floor(i/2)*0.08, 3.1 + (i%2)*0.12 + Math.floor(i/2)*0.08);\n      // 用 easeInOut 但带轻微错位\n      var mve = easeInOut(mv);\n      var target = squareTarget(i);\n\n      var cx = startP.x + (target.x - startP.x) * mve;\n      var cy = startP.y + (target.y - startP.y) * mve;\n\n      // 4.0 后：方块收缩消失（左侧阵列收缩为细进度线）\n      var fadeOut = 1 - easeOut(seg(t, 4.0, 4.6));\n\n      // 7.0 后：再次淡出（清晰停留前）\n      var endFade = 1 - easeOut(seg(t, 8.8, 9.4));\n\n      el.style.opacity = (ap * fadeOut * endFade).toFixed(3);\n      el.style.left = cx+'px';\n      el.style.top = cy+'px';\n      // 缩放：出现时轻微放大\n      var sc = 0.85 + 0.15*ap;\n      el.style.transform = 'scale('+sc.toFixed(3)+')';\n    });\n\n    // 分支曲线：1.5–4.0 显现，4.0 淡出\n    var branchAlpha = 1;\n    if(t < 1.6) branchAlpha = easeOut(seg(t,1.5,1.9));\n    if(t > 3.8) branchAlpha = 1 - easeOut(seg(t,3.8,4.3));\n    if(t > 8.8) branchAlpha *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.8,9.4));\n\n    branchPaths.forEach(function(p, idx){\n      var n = branchNode[idx];\n      // 起点：方块区域右缘\n      var sx = baseX + 2*(sqSize+sqGapX) - 6;\n      var sy = baseY + idx*(sqSize+sqGapY) + sqSize/2;\n      var ex = n.x - 8, ey = n.y;\n      var mx = (sx+ex)/2 + 40;\n      var d = 'M '+sx+' '+sy+' C '+mx+' '+sy+', '+mx+' '+ey+', '+ex+' '+ey;\n      p.setAttribute('d', d);\n      var draw = easeOut(seg(t, 1.6 + idx*0.12, 2.4 + idx*0.12));\n      p.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '600');\n      p.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset', (600*(1-draw)).toFixed(1));\n      p.setAttribute('opacity', branchAlpha.toFixed(3));\n    });\n\n    // 节点圆点 2.0–4.0\n    nodeCircles.forEach(function(c, idx){\n      var a = easeOut(seg(t, 2.2 + idx*0.15, 2.7 + idx*0.15));\n      if(t > 3.8) a *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,3.8,4.2));\n      if(t > 8.8) a *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.8,9.4));\n      c.setAttribute('opacity', a.toFixed(3));\n      var pulse = 1;\n      if(t>2.7 && t<4.0){ pulse = 1 + 0.12*Math.sin((t-2.7)*6); }\n      c.setAttribute('r', (6*pulse).toFixed(2));\n    });\n\n    // 提示文字 1.5–4.0\n    hintEls.forEach(function(el, idx){\n      var a = easeOut(seg(t, 2.3 + idx*0.15, 2.9 + idx*0.15));\n      if(t > 3.7) a *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,3.7,4.1));\n      if(t > 8.8) a *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.8,9.4));\n      el.style.opacity = a.toFixed(3);\n      el.style.transform = 'translateX(' + ((1-a)*10) + 'px)';\n    });\n\n    // 汇合曲线 4.0–5.2 出现，5.2–6.2 淡出\n    var mergeAlpha = 0;\n    if(t >= 4.0) mergeAlpha = easeOut(seg(t,4.0,4.6));\n    if(t > 5.4) mergeAlpha *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,5.4,6.3));\n\n    mergePaths.forEach(function(p, idx){\n      var n = branchNode[idx];\n      var sx = n.x + 8, sy = n.y;\n      var ex = box.x - 6, ey = box.y + box.h*0.5;\n      var mx = (sx+ex)/2 + 20;\n      var d = 'M '+sx+' '+sy+' C '+mx+' '+sy+', '+mx+' '+ey+', '+ex+' '+ey;\n      p.setAttribute('d', d);\n      var draw = easeOut(seg(t, 4.0 + idx*0.1, 4.8 + idx*0.1));\n      p.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '400');\n      p.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset', (400*(1-draw)).toFixed(1));\n      p.setAttribute('opacity', mergeAlpha.toFixed(3));\n    });\n\n    // 预览框四条边描边 4.0–5.5\n    edgeDefs.forEach(function(e, idx){\n      var el = edgeEls[idx];\n      var p = easeOut(seg(t, e.delay, e.delay+0.55));\n      var isHoriz = (e.y1===e.y2);\n      var thick = 3;\n      if(isHoriz){\n        el.style.height = thick+'px';\n        el.style.top = (e.y1 - thick/2)+'px';\n        var fullW = box.w;\n        el.style.width = (fullW*p).toFixed(1)+'px';\n        el.style.left = (e.x1===0 ? 0 : (box.w - fullW*p)) + 'px';\n      } else {\n        el.style.width = thick+'px';\n        el.style.left = (e.x1 - thick/2)+'px';\n        var fullH = box.h;\n        el.style.height = (fullH*p).toFixed(1)+'px';\n        el.style.top = (e.y1===0 ? 0 : (box.h - fullH*p)) + 'px';\n      }\n      el.style.opacity = p>0 ? '1' : '0';\n    });\n\n    // 「故事预览」4.0 出现，保持到 10.0\n    var titleA = easeOut(seg(t, 4.35, 4.95));\n    prevText.style.opacity = titleA.toFixed(3);\n    prevText.style.left = (box.x + box.w/2)+'px';\n    prevText.style.top = (box.y + box.h/2 - 30)+'px';\n    prevText.style.transform = 'translateX(-50%)';\n    prevText.style.letterSpacing = '4px';\n\n    // 副标题 素材 → 镜头 → 成片 4.8 出现，8.5 淡出\n    var subA = easeOut(seg(t,4.8,5.3));\n    if(t > 8.0) subA *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.0,8.5));\n    prevSub.style.opacity = subA.toFixed(3);\n    prevSub.style.left = (box.x + box.w/2)+'px';\n    prevSub.style.top = (box.y + box.h/2 + 36)+'px';\n    prevSub.style.transform = 'translateX(-50%)';\n    prevSub.style.whiteSpace = 'nowrap';\n\n    // 进度线 7.0–9.0 从左侧阵列位置收缩出现\n    var plA = easeOut(seg(t, 7.0, 7.6));\n    plA *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t, 9.3, 9.7));\n    progressLine.style.opacity = plA.toFixed(3);\n    var plW = 220 * easeInOut(seg(t, 7.0, 8.0));\n    progressLine.style.width = plW.toFixed(1)+'px';\n    progressLine.style.left = baseX+'px';\n    progressLine.style.top = (baseY + 3*(sqSize+sqGapY)/2 - 1)+'px';\n\n    // 取景角标 7.2 出现，8.9 淡出\n    var cornerA = easeOut(seg(t,7.2,7.7));\n    if(t > 8.3) cornerA *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.3,8.9));\n    cornerEls.forEach(function(c){\n      c.setAttribute('opacity', cornerA.toFixed(3));\n      var s = 1;\n      if(t>7.7 && t<8.3){ s = 1 + 0.08*Math.sin((t-7.7)*7); }\n      c.setAttribute('transform', 'translate(0,0) scale('+s.toFixed(3)+')');\n      // 围绕各自角点缩放 - 简单处理：直接调整路径 stroke 宽度\n      c.setAttribute('stroke-width', (3*s).toFixed(2));\n    });\n\n    // 预览框背景：在描边过程中逐渐显现\n    var boxBgA = easeOut(seg(t,4.2,5.2));\n    if(t > 8.9) boxBgA *= 1 - easeOut(seg(t,8.9,9.5));\n    previewBox.style.background = 'rgba(247,249,255,'+(0.9*boxBgA).toFixed(3)+')';\n    previewBox.style.borderRadius = '6px';\n\n    // 预览框内的元素(故事预览/副标题)整体在最后轻微淡出? 保持到末帧不空\n    // 让标题在 9.6 后保持最小可见，避免空白\n    if(t > 9.5){\n      var k = 1 - (t-9.5)/0.5*0.15; // 轻微降到 85%\n      prevText.style.opacity = (titleA*k).toFixed(3);\n    }\n  };\n\n  window.renderAt(0);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      {
        "id": "c14e8c277936402cb041503a8169b098",
        "title": "每个镜头，都能再调整",
        "description": "【画幅与基调】延续白底、蓝色线框，构图改为上中下三层动作展示，不复用第一段的左图右框布局。无旁白、无配乐。\n\n【0.0–2.0s】画面顶部居中先出现一句中文标题「每个镜头，都能再调整」，停留 2 秒。下方出现一条水平时间线，线上有 3 个蓝色镜头片段矩形。\n\n【2.0–5.0s】第一动作「时长」：时间线中间片段被选中（矩形加粗描边），其右边缘出现双向箭头，片段长度向右延展一小段，上方浮出小字「时长」。延展后的片段保持选中态。\n\n【5.0–7.5s】第二动作「字幕」：选中片段下方出现一条细横线，横线上从左到右逐字出现示例字幕文字「镜头，可以再调整」，文字以轻淡入方式显示，旁边浮出标签「字幕」。\n\n【7.5–10.0s】第三动作「替换镜头」：选中片段内部出现一个圆形循环箭头图标，片段底色由浅蓝变成更深的蓝，其右侧推入一个等宽的新片段矩形，旧片段的循环图标淡出，标签「替换镜头」短暂出现；随后顶部标题与时间线整体上移淡出，中央出现收尾中文「让想法成为下一部片子」，停留至 10.0s。\n\n【实际画面文字与出现时间】「每个镜头，都能再调整」0.0s 出现、8.0s 淡出；「时长」2.0s 出现、5.0s 淡出；「字幕」5.0s 出现、7.5s 淡出；示例字幕「镜头，可以再调整」5.5s 出现、8.0s 淡出；「替换镜头」7.5s 出现、9.0s 淡出；「让想法成为下一部片子」8.5s 淡入并保持到 10.0s。",
        "duration": 10.0,
        "source_revision_id": "8bdc70997a1e405bb7fc0e99c81210e9",
        "source_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>每个镜头，都能再调整</title>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#ffffff;}\n  #stage{position:relative;width:1280px;height:720px;overflow:hidden;background:#ffffff;\n    font-family:'PingFang SC','Arial',sans-serif;}\n  .abs{position:absolute;}\n  .title{left:0;width:1280px;text-align:center;color:#0B3C78;\n    font-size:44px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;}\n  .label{color:#1668C9;font-size:28px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;white-space:nowrap;}\n  .sub{color:#3B6EA8;font-size:28px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;white-space:nowrap;}\n  .closing{left:0;width:1280px;text-align:center;color:#0B3C78;font-size:52px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;}\n  .seg{position:absolute;background:#EAF2FC;border:2px solid #1668C9;border-radius:8px;box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .seg-sel{background:#DCEBFC;border-width:4px;}\n  .seg-new{background:#EAF2FC;border:2px dashed #1668C9;}\n  .seg-deep{background:#1668C9;border-color:#0B3C78;}\n  .seg-deep-label{position:absolute;color:#ffffff;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .timeline{position:absolute;height:2px;background:#BBD3EE;}\n  .tick{position:absolute;width:2px;height:14px;background:#BBD3EE;}\n  #capLine{position:absolute;height:2px;background:#1668C9;}\n  #capText{position:absolute;color:#0B3C78;font-size:30px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;white-space:nowrap;}\n  .arrowhead{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"stage\">\n  <div id=\"title\" class=\"abs title\">每个镜头，都能再调整</div>\n\n  <div id=\"tlLine\" class=\"timeline\"></div>\n  <div id=\"tlTick1\" class=\"tick\"></div>\n  <div id=\"tlTick2\" class=\"tick\"></div>\n  <div id=\"tlTick3\" class=\"tick\"></div>\n\n  <div id=\"seg1\" class=\"seg\"></div>\n  <div id=\"seg2\" class=\"seg seg-sel\"></div>\n  <div id=\"seg3\" class=\"seg\"></div>\n  <div id=\"seg4\" class=\"seg seg-new\"></div>\n\n  <div id=\"deepLabel\" class=\"seg-deep-label\">镜头</div>\n\n  <div id=\"durArrowL\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"durArrowR\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"durLabel\" class=\"abs label\">时长</div>\n\n  <div id=\"capLine\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"capText\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"capLabel\" class=\"abs label\">字幕</div>\n\n  <div id=\"loopIcon\" class=\"abs\"></div>\n  <div id=\"repLabel\" class=\"abs label\">替换镜头</div>\n\n  <div id=\"closing\" class=\"abs closing\">让想法成为下一部片子</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n\n  var titleEl = document.getElementById('title');\n  var tlLine = document.getElementById('tlLine');\n  var ticks = [document.getElementById('tlTick1'),document.getElementById('tlTick2'),document.getElementById('tlTick3')];\n  var seg1 = document.getElementById('seg1');\n  var seg2 = document.getElementById('seg2');\n  var seg3 = document.getElementById('seg3');\n  var seg4 = document.getElementById('seg4');\n  var deepLabel = document.getElementById('deepLabel');\n  var durArrowL = document.getElementById('durArrowL');\n  var durArrowR = document.getElementById('durArrowR');\n  var durLabel = document.getElementById('durLabel');\n  var capLine = document.getElementById('capLine');\n  var capText = document.getElementById('capText');\n  var capLabel = document.getElementById('capLabel');\n  var loopIcon = document.getElementById('loopIcon');\n  var repLabel = document.getElementById('repLabel');\n  var closingEl = document.getElementById('closing');\n\n  // ---- base geometry ----\n  var TL_Y = 372;            // timeline y\n  var TL_X = 230;            // timeline start x\n  var TL_W = 820;            // timeline width\n  var SEG_H = 58;\n  var SEG_Y = TL_Y - SEG_H - 22;   // segments sit above line\n\n  var S1_X = 280, S1_W = 170;\n  var S2_X = 500, S2_W = 240;      // selected, grows to 320\n  var S3_X = 800, S3_W = 190;\n  var GROW = 80;                    // duration extension\n\n  var SEG1_Y = SEG_Y;\n\n  // timeline elements\n  tlLine.style.left = TL_X+'px';\n  tlLine.style.top = TL_Y+'px';\n  tlLine.style.width = TL_W+'px';\n  var tickXs = [TL_X, TL_X + TL_W/2, TL_X + TL_W];\n  for(var i=0;i<3;i++){\n    ticks[i].style.left = tickXs[i]+'px';\n    ticks[i].style.top = (TL_Y-6)+'px';\n  }\n\n  seg1.style.top = SEG1_Y+'px';\n  seg2.style.top = SEG1_Y+'px';\n  seg3.style.top = SEG1_Y+'px';\n  seg4.style.top = SEG1_Y+'px';\n\n  // deep label inside seg2\n  deepLabel.style.top = (SEG1_Y + 15)+'px';\n  deepLabel.style.left = (S2_X + 22)+'px';\n\n  // duration label above seg2 right edge\n  durLabel.style.top = (SEG1_Y - 52)+'px';\n\n  // caption line below seg2\n  var CAP_Y = TL_Y + 46;\n  capLine.style.left = (S2_X + 20)+'px';\n  capLine.style.top = CAP_Y+'px';\n  capLine.style.width = (S2_W - 40)+'px';\n\n  capText.style.left = (S2_X + 30)+'px';\n  capText.style.top = (CAP_Y + 16)+'px';\n  capText.textContent = '';\n\n  capLabel.style.left = (S2_X + 30)+'px';\n  capLabel.style.top = (CAP_Y + 70)+'px';\n\n  // replace label to right of seg2 near new seg\n  repLabel.style.left = '620px';\n  repLabel.style.top = (SEG1_Y + 16)+'px';\n\n  // loop icon (SVG) inside seg2\n  loopIcon.innerHTML =\n    '<svg width=\"44\" height=\"44\" viewBox=\"0 0 44 44\">'+\n    '<path d=\"M12 18 A12 12 0 1 1 12 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B3C78\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>'+\n    '<polygon points=\"12,11 12,25 23,18\" fill=\"#0B3C78\"/>'+\n    '</svg>';\n  loopIcon.style.left = (S2_X + S2_W/2 - 22)+'px';\n  loopIcon.style.top = (SEG1_Y + SEG_H/2 - 22)+'px';\n\n  // duration arrowheads drawn as SVG-ish triangles via clip-path boxes\n  durArrowL.innerHTML = '<svg width=\"20\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 26\"><polygon points=\"18,2 18,24 2,13\" fill=\"#1668C9\"/></svg>';\n  durArrowR.innerHTML = '<svg width=\"20\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 26\"><polygon points=\"2,2 2,24 18,13\" fill=\"#1668C9\"/></svg>';\n\n  // ---- easing ----\n  function clamp01(x){ return x<0?0:(x>1?1:x); }\n  function easeOutCubic(x){ x=clamp01(x); return 1-Math.pow(1-x,3); }\n  function easeInOutSine(x){ x=clamp01(x); return -(Math.cos(Math.PI*x)-1)/2; }\n  function seg(a,b,t){ return clamp01((t-a)/(b-a)); }\n\n  function setOp(el,o){ el.style.opacity = o; }\n\n  function render(t){\n    t = Math.max(0, Math.min(10, t));\n\n    // ---------------- title ----------------\n    var tIn = easeOutCubic(seg(0.0,0.8,t));\n    var tOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.3,8.0,t));\n    titleEl.style.top = (34 + (1-tIn)*22 - tOut*30)+'px';\n    titleEl.style.opacity = String(tIn * (1-tOut));\n\n    // ---------------- timeline + segments enter ----------------\n    var tlIn = easeOutCubic(seg(0.5,1.4,t));\n    var tlOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.3,8.0,t));\n    var tlAlpha = tlIn*(1-tlOut);\n    var tlShift = -tlOut*40;\n    tlLine.style.opacity = String(tlAlpha);\n    tlLine.style.transform = 'scaleX('+tlIn+') translateY('+tlShift+'px)';\n    tlLine.style.transformOrigin = 'left center';\n    for(var i=0;i<3;i++){\n      ticks[i].style.opacity = String(tlAlpha);\n      ticks[i].style.transform = 'translateY('+tlShift+'px)';\n    }\n\n    // base segment positions\n    var s1in = easeOutCubic(seg(0.9,1.7,t));\n    var s2in = easeOutCubic(seg(1.0,1.8,t));\n    var s3in = easeOutCubic(seg(1.1,1.9,t));\n\n    // duration growth of seg2: 2.5 -> 3.8\n    var grow = easeInOutSine(seg(2.5,3.8,t)) * GROW;\n    var s2w = S2_W + grow;\n\n    // replace action 7.5 -> 8.6: seg2 deepens, new segment slides in from right of seg2\n    var repl = easeInOutSine(seg(7.5,8.6,t));\n    // compressed shift: seg3 slides right to make room for new seg, then new seg arrives\n    var s3shift = easeInOutSine(seg(7.5,8.5,t)) * 0;\n\n    // final fade of timeline group at 7.9 - 8.6 partly overlapping; but keep visible until 8.0\n    var groupOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.9,8.7,t));\n    var groupAlpha = (1-groupOut);\n\n    function placeSeg(el, x, w, inP, alphaMul){\n      el.style.left = x+'px';\n      el.style.width = w+'px';\n      el.style.height = SEG_H+'px';\n      var a = inP*(alphaMul===undefined?1:alphaMul)*groupAlpha;\n      el.style.opacity = String(clamp01(a));\n      el.style.transform = 'translateY('+((1-inP)*16 + tlShift)+'px)';\n    }\n\n    placeSeg(seg1, S1_X, S1_W, s1in);\n    placeSeg(seg2, S2_X, s2w, s2in);\n    placeSeg(seg3, S3_X + s3shift, S3_W, s3in);\n\n    // deep color on seg2 at replace time\n    var deepT = easeOutCubic(seg(7.6,8.3,t));\n    // seg2 background interpolate #DCEBFC -> #1668C9\n    var r1=220,g1=235,b1=252, r2=22,g2=104,b2=201;\n    var rr = Math.round(r1+(r2-r1)*deepT);\n    var gg = Math.round(g1+(g2-g1)*deepT);\n    var bb = Math.round(b1+(b2-b1)*deepT);\n    seg2.style.background = 'rgb('+rr+','+gg+','+bb+')';\n    seg2.style.borderColor = deepT>0.5 ? '#0B3C78' : '#1668C9';\n\n    // deep label fades in when deep starts\n    var dlIn = easeOutCubic(seg(7.7,8.3,t));\n    deepLabel.style.opacity = String(dlIn*groupAlpha*0.95);\n    deepLabel.style.transform = 'translateY('+((1-dlIn)*8)+'px)';\n\n    // loop icon inside seg2: 7.5 in, 8.4 out\n    var lIn = easeOutCubic(seg(7.4,8.0,t));\n    var lOut = easeOutCubic(seg(8.2,8.7,t));\n    loopIcon.style.opacity = String(lIn*(1-lOut)*groupAlpha);\n    loopIcon.style.transform = 'rotate('+((1-lIn)*0 + lOut*90)+'deg) scale('+(0.6+0.4*lIn)+')';\n    loopIcon.style.display = 'block';\n\n    // new segment (seg4) slides in from right of seg2\n    var nIn = easeOutCubic(seg(7.8,8.6,t));\n    var seg4X = S2_X + s2w + 26;\n    placeSeg(seg4, seg4X, 150, nIn);\n    // its dashed border become normal?\n    seg4.style.opacity = String(clamp01(nIn*groupAlpha));\n    seg4.style.transform = 'translateX('+((1-nIn)*60)+'px) translateY('+tlShift+'px)';\n\n    renderDuration(t, grow, groupAlpha, tlShift);\n    renderCaption(t, groupAlpha, tlShift);\n    renderReplaceLabel(t, groupAlpha, tlShift);\n    renderClosing(t);\n  }\n\n  function renderDuration(t, grow, groupAlpha, shift){\n    // arrow appears 2.3 -> 2.9, extends with grow\n    var aIn = easeOutCubic(seg(2.3,2.9,t));\n    var aOut = easeOutCubic(seg(4.6,5.1,t));\n    var a = aIn*(1-aOut)*groupAlpha;\n\n    var baseRight = S2_X + S2_W + grow;  // right edge of seg2\n    var midY = SEG1_Y + SEG_H/2;\n    var armLen = 58;\n    // two-headed arrow centered on right edge\n    durArrowL.style.left = (baseRight - armLen - 10)+'px';\n    durArrowL.style.top = (midY - 13)+'px';\n    durArrowL.style.opacity = String(a);\n    var shake = 1 + 0.0;\n\n    durArrowR.style.left = (baseRight + 10)+'px';\n    durArrowR.style.top = (midY - 13)+'px';\n    durArrowR.style.opacity = String(a);\n\n    // a thin line connecting the two arrowheads\n    // (use durLabel line via border) - draw with durArrowL/R; add small connector\n    var conn = document.getElementById('durConn');\n    if(!conn){\n      conn = document.createElement('div');\n      conn.id='durConn';\n      conn.className='abs';\n      conn.style.height='2px';\n      conn.style.background='#1668C9';\n      stage.appendChild(conn);\n    }\n    conn.style.left = (baseRight - armLen)+'px';\n    conn.style.top = (midY-1)+'px';\n    conn.style.width = (armLen*2)+'px';\n    conn.style.opacity = String(a*0.8);\n\n    var lbIn = easeOutCubic(seg(2.5,3.1,t));\n    var lbOut = easeOutCubic(seg(4.6,5.1,t));\n    var la = lbIn*(1-lbOut)*groupAlpha;\n    durLabel.style.left = (baseRight - 34)+'px';\n    durLabel.style.top = (SEG1_Y - 50 + (1-lbIn)*10)+'px';\n    durLabel.style.opacity = String(la);\n  }\n\n  function renderCaption(t, groupAlpha, shift){\n    // caption line 5.0 -> 7.5ish\n    var liIn = easeOutCubic(seg(4.9,5.4,t));\n    var liOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.4,7.9,t));\n    var la = liIn*(1-liOut)*groupAlpha;\n    capLine.style.opacity = String(la);\n    capLine.style.transform = 'scaleX('+liIn+')';\n    capLine.style.transformOrigin = 'left center';\n\n    var full = '镜头，可以再调整';\n    // typed from 5.5 to 7.0\n    var p = easeInOutSine(seg(5.5,7.0,t));\n    var n = Math.round(p * full.length);\n    capText.textContent = full.slice(0, n);\n    capText.style.opacity = String(clamp01(p*2)*groupAlpha);\n\n    var lbIn = easeOutCubic(seg(5.1,5.6,t));\n    var lbOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.4,7.9,t));\n    capLabel.style.opacity = String(lbIn*(1-lbOut)*groupAlpha);\n    capLabel.style.transform = 'translateY('+((1-lbIn)*10)+'px)';\n\n    var clOut = easeOutCubic(seg(7.7,8.2,t));\n    capText.style.opacity = String(clamp01(p*2)*groupAlpha*(1-clOut*0.9));\n    capLabel.style.opacity = String(lbIn*(1-lbOut)*groupAlpha);\n  }\n\n  function renderReplaceLabel(t, groupAlpha, shift){\n    var lIn = easeOutCubic(seg(7.5,8.0,t));\n    var lOut = easeOutCubic(seg(8.5,9.0,t));\n    var a = lIn*(1-lOut)*groupAlpha;\n    repLabel.style.opacity = String(a);\n    repLabel.style.transform = 'translateY('+((1-lIn)*12)+'px)';\n  }\n\n  function renderClosing(t){\n    var cIn = easeOutCubic(seg(8.5,9.3,t));\n    var hold = easeInOutSine(seg(9.0,9.6,t));\n    closingEl.style.opacity = String(cIn);\n    closingEl.style.top = (322 + (1-cIn)*18)+'px';\n    // subtle underline growth\n    var ul = document.getElementById('closeUnderline');\n    if(!ul){\n      ul = document.createElement('div');\n      ul.id='closeUnderline';\n      ul.className='abs';\n      ul.style.height='3px';\n      ul.style.background='#1668C9';\n      ul.style.borderRadius='2px';\n      stage.appendChild(ul);\n    }\n    var w = 360 * easeOutCubic(seg(8.9,9.6,t));\n    ul.style.width = w+'px';\n    ul.style.left = (640 - w/2)+'px';\n    ul.style.top = (392)+'px';\n    ul.style.opacity = String(seg(8.9,9.4,t));\n  }\n\n  window.renderAt = render;\n  render(0);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
      }
    ]
  }
